<DocsExample TExample="VirtualizeBasicExample" Title="Items provider" Description="ItemsProvider supplies only the window of items currently needed. Scroll the container to load more." />
<DocsExample TExample="VirtualizeItemSizeExample" Title="Item size and empty state" Description="ItemSize sets the row height in pixels. EmptyTemplate renders when the provider reports no items." />
<DocsExample TExample="VirtualizeMeasuredExample" Title="Measured variable-height items" Description="MeasureItemSize measures rows whose height depends on their content, so scrolling, loading, and re-rendering keep the visible row in place. Each item's root element carries data-nt-virtualize-index, and ItemSize is the estimate for rows not yet measured. Use padding rather than vertical margins, which are not measured." />
<DocsExample TExample="VirtualizeLoadingExample" Title="Slow data with a loading template" Description="LoadingTemplate fills rows that are still being fetched from a slow source. A data-nt-virtualize-placeholder attribute on its root crossfades each placeholder into its loaded row." />
